Security-relevant decisions:
- Uses `react-native-keychain` with `ACCESS_CONTROL.BIOMETRY_CURRENT_SET` — invalidates on biometric enrollment change
- Credentials stored with `WHEN_UNLOCKED_THIS_DEVICE_ONLY` — never synced to iCloud/Google backup
- `android:allowBackup="false"` and backup rules exclude all app data
- No tokens in AsyncStorage, SharedPreferences, or plaintext — only hardware-backed keystore/secure enclave
- Biometric prompt required at both storage and retrieval time
- Login stores refresh token equivalent; access tokens stay in memory only
- Full self-audit gate passed: no cleartext storage, no weak fallbacks, no bundled secrets
